@startuml H-38-componentes
' arVault - TP1 Arquitectura del Software (75.73/TB034) 2026C2
' Diagrama de Componentes (UML) del caso H-38: TLS terminado en nginx
' (táctica Encrypt Data). Parte del caso base; lo que cambia va en verde.
' Render: mise run diagrams
'
' Las firmas de cada interfaz y la justificación de cada decisión están
' en doc/diagramas/README.md (tablas de componentes e interfaces).

title arVault — Caso H-38 (Encrypt Data): diagrama de componentes (UML)

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #ECEFF1
  BorderColor #546E7A
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #546E7A
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  BorderColor #90A4AE
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #B0883B
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E1
  BorderColor #B0883B
}

' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 1. Clientes y generador de carga
' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
package "Clientes" <<boundary>> #F5F5F5 {
  component "Apps móviles\n(tercerizadas)" <<client>> as MobileApp
  component "vaultSec\nAuthN / AuthZ" <<fuera de alcance>> as VaultSec
  component "Artillery\n+ plugin StatsD" <<load generator>> as Artillery

  MobileApp -[hidden]right- VaultSec
  VaultSec -[hidden]right- Artillery
}

' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' 2. Servidor único (Docker Compose, proyecto `exchange`)
' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
package "Servidor único — Docker Compose (proyecto `exchange`)" <<device>> {

  interface "IPublicHTTPS" as IPublicHTTPS #C8E6C9
  interface "IRedirectHTTP" as IRedirectHTTP #C8E6C9
  component "nginx 1.29.8\n**terminación TLS**\nTLS 1.2 / 1.3 · HSTS\ncert. ECDSA P-256\n//certs/, montaje ro//" <<reverse proxy>> as Nginx #C8E6C9
  interface "IExchangeREST" as IExchangeREST

  package "exchange-api-1 <<container node:24>>" as ApiContainer {
    component "app.js\nExpress HTTP API" <<presentación>> as App
    interface "IExchangeCore" as IExchangeCore
    component "exchange.js\nLógica de negocio" <<dominio>> as Exchange
    interface "ITransfer" as ITransfer
    component "Servicio de\ntransferencia de fondos\n//stub en exchange.js//\n200–400 ms · siempre OK\n**2 llamadas secuenciales**\n**por POST /exchange**" <<external>> as TransferSvc #FFE0B2
    interface "IState" as IState
    component "state.js\nEstado en memoria\n+ persistencia diferida" <<persistencia>> as State
    interface "IFileSystem" as IFileSystem
    artifact "accounts.json\nrates.json\nlog.json" as StateFiles
  }

  component "Docker Engine" <<runtime>> as Docker

  package "Observabilidad" {
    component "cAdvisor v0.51\nlee /var/run/docker.sock\n--docker_only=true" <<agente>> as Cadvisor
    interface "IStatsD" as IStatsD
    component "StatsD\nagregador (flush 1 s)" as StatsD
    component "Graphite\nCarbon + web API" <<TSDB>> as Graphite
    database "Whisper" as Whisper
    interface "IGraphiteQuery" as IGraphiteQuery
    component "Grafana 11.5\ndashboard · host :80" as Grafana
  }
}

' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' Conectores — cadena de request (arriba -> abajo)
' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MobileApp ..> VaultSec : <<HTTP>>
MobileApp ..> IPublicHTTPS : <<HTTPS>>\nrequest / response
Artillery ..> IPublicHTTPS : <<HTTPS>>\ncarga sintética
IPublicHTTPS -down- Nginx : host :5555 → :443
IRedirectHTTP -down- Nginx : host :5560 → :80\nsólo 308 → HTTPS

Nginx ..> IExchangeREST : <<HTTP proxy_pass>>\nen claro, red interna\nupstream exchange-api-1:3000
IExchangeREST -down- App

App ..> IExchangeCore : <<llamada local>>
IExchangeCore -down- Exchange

Exchange ..> ITransfer : <<async>>
ITransfer -right- TransferSvc

Exchange ..> IState : <<llamada local>>
IState -down- State

State ..> IFileSystem : <<escritura periódica>>\naccounts 1 s · log 1 s · rates 5 s
IFileSystem -down- StateFiles

' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' Conectores — observabilidad
' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
Docker -down-> Cadvisor
Cadvisor ..> IStatsD : <<UDP>>\nprefix `cadvisor`
Artillery ..> IStatsD : <<UDP>>\nprefix `artillery-api`
IStatsD -down- StatsD : :8125
StatsD -down-> Graphite : <<TCP :2003>>
Graphite -down-> Whisper : <<escribe/lee>>
Graphite -down- IGraphiteQuery : :8090
IGraphiteQuery ..> Grafana : <<datasource>>

' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' Notas (cortas, ancladas a nodos del borde para no cruzar el dibujo)
' ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
note right of VaultSec #EEEEEE
  Fuera del alcance: el request
  llega a nginx ya autenticado
  y autorizado.
end note

note bottom of StateFiles #FFF3E0
  **Componente stateful, instancia única**
  El estado vive en memoria del proceso y se
  vuelca a disco por `setInterval` ⇒ ventana de
  pérdida de 1–5 s. `log` crece sin límite y se
  reescribe entero en cada flush.
  Leer tasa → validar saldo → actualizar
  **no es atómico** ⇒ condición de carrera.
end note

legend bottom
  |= Notación |= Significado |
  | ——○ | interfaz **provista** por el componente |
  | ┄┄▷ ○ | interfaz **requerida** (dependencia) |
  | ——▶ | conector; el protocolo va en el «estereotipo» |
  | paquete | límite de despliegue (host / contenedor) |
  | verde | elemento agregado o modificado por la táctica |
  Se cifra el tramo público; nginx → api sigue en HTTP dentro de la red de Compose.
  Las firmas de cada interfaz están en `doc/diagramas/README.md`.
endlegend

@enduml
